<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>LUMINA | AI Support for Alzheimer's</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #0d0d1a, #000);
      color: white;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      background: rgba(15, 15, 47, 0.8);
      padding: 20px 5%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }
    nav a {
      margin: 0 12px;
      color: #77f5ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .hero {
      padding: 100px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #42e8e0, #b57aff);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #ccc;
    }
    .button {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: #42e8e0;
      color: #000;
      font-weight: bold;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border-radius: 30px;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #35cfd1;
    }
    section {
      padding: 60px 8%;
      border-radius: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #b57aff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
    }
    input[type="email"] {
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-right: 12px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 20px;
      width: 250px;
    }
    .confirmation {
      color: #77f5ff;
      margin-top: 15px;
      display: none;
    }
  </style>
  <script>
    function submitEmail() {
      var email = document.getElementById("email").value;
      if(email) {
        document.getElementById("confirmation").style.display = "block";
        document.getElementById("email").value = "";
      }
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div><strong>LUMINA</strong></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#technology">Technology</a>
    <a href="#team">Team</a>
    <a href="#spaces">Spaces</a>
    <a href="#waitlist">Waitlist</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>LUMINA</h1>
  <p>AI to light the way for Alzheimer’s patients. Supporting them in preserving their memories and sharing their stories. Powered by LLMs, built with care.</p>
  <button class="button" onclick="location.href='#waitlist'">Join the Waitlist</button>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About LUMINA</h2>
  <p>LUMINA is a nonprofit charity developing AI technologies to support individuals with Alzheimer’s and related memory disorders. Our mission is to restore dignity, connection, and memory through emotionally intelligent, privacy-safe systems that adapt to each person's unique cognitive journey.</p>
</section>

<section id="technology">
  <h2>Technology</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Conversational AI:</strong> Reinforces memory through natural dialogue</li>
    <li><strong>Familiar Voice Synthesis:</strong> Recreates family voices for emotional support</li>
    <li><strong>Encrypted Local Memory Storage:</strong> Ensures maximum privacy</li>
    <li><strong>Memory Token:</strong> Optional blockchain-powered utility for funding and continued care</li>
    <li><strong>Open Source Repository:</strong> View our foundational research and tools here: <a href="https://github.com/Sangeetha-maker/NeuroCare-Chatbot" target="_blank" style="color:#77f5ff;">github.com/Sangeetha-maker/NeuroCare-Chatbot</a></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="team">
  <h2>Meet the Team</h2>
  <p>LUMINA is developed by a world-class team of researchers, engineers, and designers, in working collaboration with <strong>Stanford University</strong>.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Dr. Elaine Tan</strong> — Neuro-AI Researcher (@elaine_tan_ai)</li>
    <li><strong>David Harris</strong> — Lead AI Engineer (@harristechdev)</li>
    <li><strong>Rachel Nguyen</strong> — Product Designer (@rachelbuilds)</li>
    <li><strong>Johannne Chen</strong> — Machine Learning Researcher (@jchenml)</li>
    <li><strong>Peter Mitchell</strong> — LLM Specialist (@pmitchell_ai)</li>
    <li><strong>James Robinson</strong> — Systems Architect (@robinsync)</li>
    <li><strong>Kevin Patell</strong> — Data Scientist (@kevindatasets)</li>
    <li><strong>Joshua Sharma</strong> — AI Ethicist (@jsharma_ethics)</li>
    <li><strong>Emily Sharma</strong> — Research Scientist (@emilybrainworks)</li>
    <li><strong>Daniel Iqbal</strong> — Memory UI/UX Engineer (@danielixui)</li>
    <li><strong>Sangeetha</strong> — GitHub Backend Engineer (@sangeetha_dev)</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="spaces">
  <h2>Live Twitter Spaces</h2>
  <p>🗓 <strong>April 29th, 2025 — 9:00PM EST</strong><br>
  Join us for a deep discussion on AI, memory care, and our vision for global support.<br>
  Spaces link posted on <a href="https://twitter.com/TheLuminaAI" style="color:#77f5ff;">@TheLuminaAI</a>.</p>
</section>

<section id="waitlist">
  <h2>Waitlist Access</h2>
  <p>Currently open to healthcare professionals, early supporters, and invited families. Enter your email to join the waitlist for early access, donation matching, or volunteer opportunities:</p>
  <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Enter your email">
  <button class="button" onclick="submitEmail()">Submit</button>
  <div id="confirmation" class="confirmation">✅ Email recorded. You're on the list.</div>
</section>

<footer>
  &copy; 2025 LUMINA Foundation — A 501(c)(3) Nonprofit Organization. <br>
  In collaboration with Stanford University. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
